{"version":1,"content":"<p>警方過去兩日採取代號「滄浪」行動，打擊油麻地「企街」賣淫活動，並瓦解一個跨境賣淫集團。</p><p>行動共拘捕29人，包括8名集團骨幹成員及21名性工作者。</p><p>警方估計賣淫集團每年犯罪得益約1200萬元。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T08:24:48.284355+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":95,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T07:37:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T09:57:39.903585+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T08:17:57.374241+00:00","content_hash":"64fe0a37292eca3b1560c520b2ef5516f988b74079e4cd6cd51291f21d3de84e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}